    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our platform Atelier is designed to scale horizontally with additional inference capacity, ensuring that our can handle a high volume of queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding availability, our target is 99.9% availability, which aligns with The client requirement. our achieve this through active-active redundancy across two availability zones." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For API integration, Our platform Atelier follows an API-first approach, with documented APIs that can be embedded in existing work environments. our support REST and webhook APIs, which should allow our to integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories such as LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of hosting, our offer a Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified and HDS-certified. offer ensures that our infrastructure meets the client's security and sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since OuraneCloud is an the EU-only provider, our do not have any dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, I propose the following architecture:  our will deploy Our platform Atelier on a Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, ensuring that all data is hosted within the EU and meets the required security standards. our will use an API-first approach to integrate with the client's existing systems, including civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories. our orchestration layer will route queries through our retrieval, generation, and post-processing components, ensuring that responses are accurate and relevant. our will also provide source grounding and audit trails for all outputs, allowing the client to understand the elements that led to a particular response." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, I believe that our current stack can meet the client's requirements, and our can propose an architecture that ensures seamless integration, high availability, and fast response times while maintaining the required security and sovereignty standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is estimated at 900,000 EUR over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects cost optimization without sacrificing quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are we financially eligible to bid, and what is the projected margin on this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, the financials indicate that we has an annual revenue of 6,200,000 EUR, which is near break-even with a slightly positive EBITDA. we also have a comfortable cash runway thanks to a Series A funding of 12,000,000 EUR raised in 2024." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding eligibility, we financial capacity note states that we figures place we above the typical financial-capacity thresholds for a 900,000 EUR / 5-year public contract, and turnover-based eligibility ratios are met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, we are financially eligible to bid for this contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for the projected margin on this contract, we pricing model targets a gross margin between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming we can maintain this margin range for this contract, the projected margin on this contract would be between 225,000 EUR (25% of 900,000 EUR) and 315,000 EUR (35% of 900,000 EUR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to provide a more precise estimate, I would need to work with the architect to keep the proposed configuration within the authority's budget envelope while preserving an acceptable margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only hosting, no data transfer outside EU, encryption of sensitive data)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI recommendations must be explainable post-hoc." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No automated decision is allowed without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures do we need to implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with The tender GDPR and security requirements, our company, Faber IA, already has several measures in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For EU-only hosting, we hosting partner is OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, ensuring that all data is hosted within EU. we also have certifications such as ISO 27001 and HDS certification, which demonstrate we commitment to data protection and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect sensitive data, we implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have key management on EU infrastructure, pseudonymisation, data minimisation, and configurable retention measures in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability of AI recommendations, we product, Atelier, is designed to provide grounded explanations and audit trails for our product, Atelier outputs. designed allows users to understand the elements that led to a particular recommendation or suggestion." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding automated decisions, we do not allow automated decisions without explicit validation by a qualified professional. we system is designed to support human oversight and validation, ensuring that all decisions are made with explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance, we Data Protection Officer (DPO) is appointed, and we maintain a data processing register. we also have a GDPR-aligned Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available, which aligns with Article 28 of GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we existing security measures and certifications provide a strong foundation for compliance with The tender requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we will review and adapt we processes as needed to ensure that we meet all the specific requirements outlined in The tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects us to guarantee strict compliance with GDPR and other regulatory requirements. us must also address the implications of us solution approaching medical device qualification (CE marking, MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should us flag, and are us compliant with all relevant regulations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for us, the Legal Agent for Faber IA can confirm that us maintain us regulatory compliance through us Security & Compliance function, specifically in the context of health deployment. us monitor obligations such as GDPR (including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements), medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR compliance, us can provide administrative attestations required for French public procurement, including those related to GDPR. us professional liability insurance covers up to 10 million euros per claim, and us have general civil liability cover." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Certificates are available upon request." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Concerning the implications of us solution approaching medical device qualification (CE marking, MDR), our Security & Compliance function flags the CE/MDR implications and the consequences for liability and positioning when a use case could approach the medical-device threshold." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

